# The accuracy figure is bound to a sha256 of src/langaccess/core.py, so a checkout has to
# produce the same bytes on every platform. Without this, a clone on Windows under the common
# core.autocrlf=true setting writes CRLF and the recorded hash does not reproduce.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
*.pptx binary
*.gz binary
*.parquet binary
